WEBVTT

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:06.940
So beautiful...

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:09.700
You look just like her...

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:13.240
My perfect, beloved little girl.

00:00:14.360 --> 00:00:17.600
Cardia, my beloved daughter...

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:20.070
My most precious...

00:00:21.390 --> 00:00:22.740
<i>Why?</i>

00:00:24.050 --> 00:00:25.180
Cardia...

00:00:26.260 --> 00:00:29.020
<i>Why won't you love me?</i>

00:00:29.410 --> 00:00:32.270
<i>Look at me, Father...</i>

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:53.670
These clothes don't suit you at all.

00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:02.210
This ship must have surprised you, right?

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:05.030
I used it on them because 
it seemed amusing.

00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:09.760
Amusing? You destroyed 
London just for that?

00:01:10.290 --> 00:01:14.230
You didn't think about all 
the people who live here?

00:01:16.620 --> 00:01:18.580
What are you talking about?

00:01:19.550 --> 00:01:23.090
The thing that will destroy not 
only London, but all the world

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:26.550
will be your Horologium.

00:01:29.520 --> 00:01:30.560
Stop...

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:32.390
Stay away!

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:40.640
<i>It's hot...</i>

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.450
Now the awakening will begin.

00:01:45.900 --> 00:01:47.720
The Horologium's awakening!

00:01:49.860 --> 00:01:51.980
Ah, Father...

00:01:53.670 --> 00:01:55.020
Cardia.

00:01:57.110 --> 00:01:58.950
My beloved daughter.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:03.840
At last, the time has come for 
my dearest wish to come true.

00:02:05.080 --> 00:02:07.170
Father...

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:12.000
The world will transform from a god's cradle
 to a world of great knowledge.

00:02:12.430 --> 00:02:16.000
You will guide the people there, Cardia.

00:02:16.550 --> 00:02:19.890
It all begins with you.

00:04:10.540 --> 00:04:12.470
What in the world is that?

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:15.350
I believe this is his specialty.

00:04:15.740 --> 00:04:17.720
What do you say, Impey?

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:21.470
To be honest, if we're up against 
the Nautilus, there's really no hope.

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:24.030
We can't just jump in and take it down.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:27.990
It's an impregnable flying fortress.

00:04:29.270 --> 00:04:30.990
From the condition of the victims,

00:04:30.990 --> 00:04:34.580
the weapon it used was clearly...

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:36.290
Zicterium.

00:04:39.500 --> 00:04:41.960
After Isaac took over my research,

00:04:41.960 --> 00:04:45.320
I believe he took some of it
 when he disappeared.

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:51.130
I hear that the so-called key to initiating 
Code: Realize was stolen, as well.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:55.890
If that's true, it is only a matter of time 
before the enemy breaks this silence.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:04:58.520
Your Majesty, your decision, please.

00:04:58.970 --> 00:05:01.200
It's clear what we must do.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:04.390
Reinforce our troops at once.

00:05:04.910 --> 00:05:08.940
Recruit volunteers until we have a force 
capable of standing up to the Nautilus.

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:09.640
Ma'am!

00:05:10.120 --> 00:05:13.260
When unable to gauge 
the other side's power,

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:16.410
defense is more important than offense.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:20.670
How long will it take to 
reinforce the airships' armor?

00:05:20.940 --> 00:05:23.920
A few days, at least.

00:05:24.480 --> 00:05:25.790
That long?

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:55.070
What are you planning to do?

00:05:55.590 --> 00:05:57.930
We've got the ornithopter 
back at the mansion.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:07.340
Don't bother. It's suicide.

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:09.850
What can you do in your condition?

00:06:10.460 --> 00:06:14.340
I promised to steal her back.

00:06:14.780 --> 00:06:16.830
I don't care if the poison doesn't go away.

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:18.520
As long as...

00:06:19.730 --> 00:06:21.970
As long as she's alive and by my side,

00:06:21.970 --> 00:06:23.470
I can make her smile.

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:27.480
Even if I can't touch her, 
it's better than losing her!

00:06:27.750 --> 00:06:28.490
Why?!

00:06:28.970 --> 00:06:30.980
Why didn't you fire in there?!

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:33.620
If you'd destroyed the real Finis,

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:35.490
Cardia would still be...

00:06:37.050 --> 00:06:40.240
I wanted to make her dream come true.

00:06:41.110 --> 00:06:42.550
I know, it's not like me.

00:06:43.230 --> 00:06:45.910
What he said made my heart waver.

00:06:46.520 --> 00:06:49.560
You're right. Even if the poison stays,

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:51.820
she may still be able to live on.

00:06:52.140 --> 00:06:53.880
And with Finis gone,

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:57.070
she wouldn't have to be used for 
her father's twisted fantasies.

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:59.510
No one would ever come after her again.

00:07:01.070 --> 00:07:03.820
But, still...

00:07:04.570 --> 00:07:09.060
Still, wasn't her wish to 
be able to touch you?

00:07:10.150 --> 00:07:14.640
To be held in your arms,
 like any normal girl would wish for?

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:18.540
Weren't you going to grant her wish?

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:22.680
Are you going to give up on her dream?

00:07:25.580 --> 00:07:27.400
You're exactly right.

00:07:31.030 --> 00:07:35.050
I didn't get to tell her the one
 thing that mattered most.

00:07:35.650 --> 00:07:41.010
I wouldn't regret giving up
 everything if it was for her sake.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.750
Even if I have to sacrifice myself.

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:47.310
I love her.

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:54.320
Then my only job is to take you to her.

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:01.090
We're going to save her, Lupin.

00:08:06.480 --> 00:08:07.270
Yeah.

00:08:07.540 --> 00:08:11.890
I don't ever want to lose the 
one most precious to me again!

00:08:16.820 --> 00:08:19.730
What're you two getting all fired up about?

00:08:19.960 --> 00:08:21.690
Impey? Fran?

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:24.930
I have a hypothesis.

00:08:25.240 --> 00:08:30.480
It's about what Finis said about
 how to get rid of Cardia's poison.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:36.960
We might be able to save both 
Cardia and this world.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:46.430
I suppose the negotiations 
are complete, then?

00:08:47.690 --> 00:08:49.740
You really think this will work?

00:08:50.000 --> 00:08:52.870
If my hypothesis is right, 
then yes, theoretically.

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.870
It's essential that we get 
her out of there first.

00:08:56.350 --> 00:08:58.140
Do you know where she is?

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.970
Based on the peculiarities of the
Nautilus, I have a general idea.

00:09:01.970 --> 00:09:05.300
General, huh? That's certainly reassuring.

00:09:05.930 --> 00:09:08.140
A guess is all we need.

00:09:08.550 --> 00:09:12.280
In any case, we'll need to 
get close to the Nautilus...

00:09:12.590 --> 00:09:13.520
Impey?

00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:15.330
I'll take care of our ride.

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:19.910
But if it hits us with a concentrated 
attack, we'll be helpless.

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:22.580
Hey!

00:09:24.190 --> 00:09:25.650
Th-There's trouble!

00:09:25.850 --> 00:09:27.100
It's the count!

00:09:28.670 --> 00:09:31.220
We sortie in the morning.

00:09:31.840 --> 00:09:35.670
I ask all of you to launch 
a full-scale attack on the Nautilus.

00:09:37.500 --> 00:09:38.480
And?

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:45.230
Are you saying those dubious-looking people 
are going to protect us with magic?

00:09:46.160 --> 00:09:49.770
Magic, eh? What a fitting way to put it.

00:09:51.510 --> 00:09:52.430
You are right.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:57.920
These people will be a great 
help to you, Your Majesty.

00:10:03.010 --> 00:10:04.200
What's that?

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.280
It's a device I've never seen before.

00:10:07.380 --> 00:10:08.690
Don't worry.

00:10:08.980 --> 00:10:11.080
It won't be used for evil.

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:15.110
Are you sure it was wise 
to accept those terms?

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.990
He defied this organization.

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:21.630
How can Idea assist someone like that?

00:10:21.950 --> 00:10:27.220
My priority is to put
 a stop to Isaac's plot.

00:10:27.220 --> 00:10:30.720
I must, as the leader of 
the overseers of history.

00:10:31.000 --> 00:10:34.150
You're saying we need them right now?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.390
Sorry for the wait!

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:12.880
The final adjustments are done!

00:11:12.880 --> 00:11:14.880
All right, we're off, then.

00:11:14.880 --> 00:11:17.900
Yes. Be careful, you three.

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:20.850
Van, are you going in
 a British Army airship?

00:11:20.850 --> 00:11:23.270
Yeah. I'll back you guys up.

00:11:23.530 --> 00:11:26.720
It'd be a disaster if you were shot 
down before we make it there.

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:29.470
I see. A wise distribution of personnel.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:32.500
Oh? Are you sure you can handle that?

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:34.620
You're hurt too, Van.

00:11:35.330 --> 00:11:36.550
Care to test me?

00:11:36.550 --> 00:11:37.870
I'm good, thanks!

00:11:41.810 --> 00:11:42.680
Van.

00:11:46.140 --> 00:11:48.010
I'm here to see you off.

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:51.390
I've decided to assist the 
humans on the ground.

00:11:52.580 --> 00:11:53.640
I see.

00:11:55.520 --> 00:11:56.640
Helsing!

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.400
Live!

00:12:02.230 --> 00:12:05.280
Cardia, too! And all of you!

00:12:05.280 --> 00:12:06.900
Come back alive!

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:13.440
Sure.

00:12:22.010 --> 00:12:23.640
Are you certain about this?

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:28.960
If we shoot down the Nautilus,
London will suffer even more damage,

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:31.380
and the recovery will take even longer.

00:12:31.870 --> 00:12:33.600
And what of it?

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:38.060
All the people of this 
country are my children.

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:41.880
Even if London is lost, 
I will protect my family.

00:12:43.230 --> 00:12:46.230
That is my job as their matriarch.

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.700
Reporting!

00:12:52.290 --> 00:12:54.590
Preparations to attack are complete.

00:12:55.880 --> 00:12:56.990
Then we depart!

00:13:09.750 --> 00:13:13.060
<i>Wait for me, Cardia.</i>

00:13:29.570 --> 00:13:33.490
<i>At last, the time has come for 
my dearest wish to come true.</i>

00:13:34.440 --> 00:13:38.130
You will guide the people there, Cardia.

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:41.940
It all begins with you.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:45.570
Father...

00:13:47.570 --> 00:13:48.670
Finis...

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:01.950
What are you trying to do?

00:14:02.770 --> 00:14:04.330
Ridiculous.

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:08.030
Treating me? You're still trying 
to keep up the human act?

00:14:08.470 --> 00:14:10.650
I'm only a doll...

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:14.670
A monster, just like you.

00:14:19.070 --> 00:14:21.920
Everything that is our father,

00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:25.670
Isaac Beckford, is contained 
within my main body.

00:14:26.320 --> 00:14:32.070
Now we need only wait for the last piece 
required for his resurrection to be complete.

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:35.640
And that is... me?

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:41.650
I will act as a vessel for
 your Horologium's energy,

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.360
and a god will be born.

00:14:43.870 --> 00:14:47.190
The creation of the new world will begin.

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:51.130
What will happen to the two of us then?

00:14:51.130 --> 00:14:56.380
The personality that resides 
in me will simply disappear,

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:59.220
as will the Horologium from your body.

00:15:00.190 --> 00:15:01.580
You mean...

00:15:01.580 --> 00:15:05.080
Yes. Your poison will disappear, too.

00:15:06.350 --> 00:15:08.710
How sad for you, though...

00:15:10.770 --> 00:15:12.590
Did you forget?

00:15:13.350 --> 00:15:17.500
The Horologium is your heart itself.

00:15:18.090 --> 00:15:23.100
Whatever happens, you cannot 
live without the Horologium.

00:15:23.300 --> 00:15:26.270
Your fate is to disappear along with me.

00:15:26.530 --> 00:15:29.820
That's what you want? To die?

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.490
Die? What of it?

00:15:33.610 --> 00:15:36.350
I was made for that very purpose.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.950
If I fulfill that purpose, 
Father will love me.

00:15:39.950 --> 00:15:41.440
He'll praise me.

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:44.130
I can't wait!

00:15:45.220 --> 00:15:46.490
That's wrong.

00:15:47.350 --> 00:15:49.870
That has to be wrong!

00:15:50.760 --> 00:15:52.730
You still don't understand?

00:16:00.080 --> 00:16:02.540
You can't stop it now.

00:16:02.540 --> 00:16:05.460
The Horologium has begun to transform.

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:09.410
Your poison will grow 
stronger and stronger,

00:16:09.710 --> 00:16:13.830
until it can kill everything around you,
 even without touching you!

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:18.940
You are indeed a highly venomous monster.

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:21.820
It's a power perfectly suited to you.

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:25.190
See? You understand now, right?

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:27.830
You are all alone...

00:16:28.060 --> 00:16:30.500
Just like me.

00:16:48.110 --> 00:16:51.840
You rabble dare to challenge my Nautilus?

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:57.110
Then help yourselves to a thorough 
taste of the power of my science!

00:16:59.230 --> 00:17:03.590
Now, let's decide the fate of this world.

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:05.000
Fire!

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:24.860
Those guys are pretty good!

00:17:27.300 --> 00:17:29.970
I knew Saint's friends would be useful!

00:17:32.100 --> 00:17:33.110
Whoa!

00:17:49.180 --> 00:17:50.380
Impey!

00:17:50.380 --> 00:17:51.620
Damn you!

00:17:54.430 --> 00:17:55.340
Let me.

00:17:58.380 --> 00:17:59.640
Crap!

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:03.880
Van!

00:18:04.840 --> 00:18:06.000
Do it now!

00:18:06.000 --> 00:18:07.020
Roger!

00:18:07.020 --> 00:18:08.650
Hold on tight!

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:12.760
Fire!

00:18:15.930 --> 00:18:17.910
Impey, are we okay?

00:18:17.910 --> 00:18:21.540
Not really, but it's all 
so we can save Cardia!

00:18:21.700 --> 00:18:23.540
What?! But...

00:18:23.820 --> 00:18:25.530
We're gonna crash!

00:18:25.530 --> 00:18:29.050
That's fine! Just crash 
right into the Nautilus!

00:18:29.050 --> 00:18:29.790
Lupin?!

00:18:30.630 --> 00:18:35.830
Hey, Lupin, what happened to "take all 
precautions and wait for the right moment"?

00:18:35.830 --> 00:18:39.460
Did you forget? 
There's more to that saying!

00:18:39.620 --> 00:18:42.310
"And at times, you must also be daring!"

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:50.440
What is that damned Nemo doing?!

00:18:51.050 --> 00:18:52.000
Lupin...

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:54.640
Sister?

00:18:56.190 --> 00:18:58.310
Where are you trying to go?

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:06.860
<i>Drink this. It will give you a peaceful death.</i>

00:19:37.210 --> 00:19:38.250
Cardia.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:41.210
Lupin...

00:20:03.490 --> 00:20:05.600
Sorry I kept you waiting.

00:20:09.340 --> 00:20:12.340
But... I can't go with you.

00:20:12.340 --> 00:20:12.980
Huh?

00:20:14.220 --> 00:20:16.740
The Horologium's poison has grown stronger.

00:20:17.680 --> 00:20:21.250
If I'm with you, you'll die, too.

00:20:21.860 --> 00:20:22.820
So...

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:25.700
we must say goodbye.

00:20:26.730 --> 00:20:28.330
You think I care about that?

00:20:29.500 --> 00:20:30.860
To hell with the poison.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:36.500
It's only natural to put your life 
on the line for the woman you love!

00:20:36.640 --> 00:20:37.710
Lupin...

00:20:43.930 --> 00:20:45.460
I love you.

00:20:45.910 --> 00:20:48.370
Even if my body erodes away,

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:50.610
I won't ever let go of your hand.

00:22:41.050 --> 00:22:44.500
Honestly, what unsightly trash you are.

00:22:46.500 --> 00:22:49.110
I won't let you get in Father's way!

00:22:57.760 --> 00:22:58.720
Cardia!

00:23:10.250 --> 00:23:11.270
Lupin...

00:23:17.470 --> 00:23:19.790
Farewell, Lupin...

00:23:20.110 --> 00:23:21.290
forever.
